- Split MathProblem (operands, answer, display text) out of Question;
  Question now extends it with id, choices, and source
- Add DIFFICULTY_RULES: inclusive number ranges for every operation at
  every level, with open spec choices documented inline
- Add formatProblemText for card text such as "7 × 8"
- Add getProblemErrors to check supported operation and level, whole
  numbers, no division by zero, correct answer, no negative answers,
  display text, and difficulty ranges
- Add tests for the rules table and validation
